			"notes": "_Before I begin, please be advised that some of the game's development tools are now controlled by the debug properties Mojang added to the game. To learn more, please read this page on the Minecraft Wiki: [https://minecraft.wiki/w/Debug_property](url)_\n\n* The patch is now updated to 1.21.9.\n\n* The debug renderer screen has been removed (the debug properties that were added in 1.21.9 can be used to enable/disable them).\n\n* The \"/warden_spawn_tracker\" command now has translations for all of the languages supported by Minecraft: Java Edition.\n\n* Updated the Fabric version."
